{"height": 4, "weight": 40, "base_experience": 270, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "hp", "value": 3}], "genus": "New Species Pokémon", "capture_rate": 45, "base_happiness": 100, "hatch_counter": 120, "growth_rate": "medium-slow", "egg_groups": ["no-eggs"], "gender_rate": -1, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "ミュウ"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Mew"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "뮤"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "夢幻"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Mew"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Mew"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Mew"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Mew"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "ミュウ"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "梦幻"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Mew"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["red", "blue", "leafgreen"], "text": "So rare that it is still said to be a mirage by many experts. Only a few people have seen it worldwide."}, {"versions": ["yellow"], "text": "When viewed through a micro­ scope, this POKéMON's short, fine, delicate hair can be seen."}, {"versions": ["gold", "heartgold"], "text": "Apparently, it appears only to those people who are pure of heart and have a strong desire to see it."}, {"versions": ["silver"], "text": "Its DNA is said to contain the genet­ ic codes of all POKéMON, so it can use all kinds of techniques."}, {"versions": ["crystal"], "text": "Because it can learn any move, some people began research to see if it is the ancestor of all POKéMON."}, {"versions": ["ruby", "sapphire"], "text": "MEW is said to possess the genetic composition of all POKéMON. It is capable of making itself invisible at will, so it entirely avoids notice even if it approaches people."}, {"versions": ["emerald"], "text": "A MEW is said to possess the genes of all POKéMON. It is capable of making itself invisible at will, so it entirely avoids notice even if it approaches people."}, {"versions": ["firered"], "text": "A POKéMON of South America that was thought to have been extinct. It is very intelligent and learns any move."}, {"versions": ["